**Description:**

`hstr` is an alternative for `string-cache` which does not support static strings and does not use a global mutex.

**NOTE**:
You must use [AtomStore](https://rustdoc.swc.rs/swc_atoms/struct.AtomStore.html) to create new `Atom`s. Otherwise it will be much slower.


 
**Related issue:**

 - Closes #4946.
 - Closes #7974.

---


